; mentat_cram: the single cram helper binary on PATH, the mentat analog of
; dune's dune_cmd. Its normalization delegates to the shared Mentat_test_censor
; library under test/support/.

; digestif signs webhook delivery bodies (the hmac-sha256 subcommand) with
; the same primitive the server's ingress verifies against.

(executable
 (name mentat_cram)
 (modules mentat_cram)
 (libraries mentat_test_censor re jsont jsont.bytesrw digestif unix))
